    "19d82b5e-48c3-4396-bb2f-ee0290d9ccc3": {
      "type": "layered-images-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16782970093787__19d82b5e-48c3-4396-bb2f-ee0290d9ccc3-heading-1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Made in Paradise",
            "heading_size": "h3"
          }
        },
        "template--16782970093787__19d82b5e-48c3-4396-bb2f-ee0290d9ccc3-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our products are made in boutique factories in sought-after destinations Bali and Colombia. Every thread is tropical at its core. In Bali, the shirts and coverups you love are hand-cut and sewn surrounded by beautiful rice fields and coconut trees. In Colombia, our swimwear is made with amor by an all-women run factory in Colombia’s capital of cool, Medellin. Kenny, Christina and the team work hand-in-hand with the factories to make every product perfect, and let’s be honest, they have a lot of fun doing it.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "template--16782970093787__19d82b5e-48c3-4396-bb2f-ee0290d9ccc3-heading-1",
        "template--16782970093787__19d82b5e-48c3-4396-bb2f-ee0290d9ccc3-text-1"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Kenny-flowers-shirts-making-process-bali-indonesia-where-made.JPG",
        "image_ratio": "landscape",
        "image_ratio_2": "square",
        "image_3": "shopify://shop_images/kenny-flowers-custom-design-painting-lemons.png",
        "image_ratio_3": "square",
        "full_width": false,
        "layout": "text_first",
        "content_alignment": "text-center",
        "content_position": "middle",
        "disable_top_spacing": false,
        "disable_bottom_spacing": false
      }
    },
    "2b4d0f83-2801-4d5b-8775-09eb965a7cc9": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16782970093787__2b4d0f83-2801-4d5b-8775-09eb965a7cc9-heading-1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "THE KENNY FLOWERS LIFESTYLE",
            "heading_size": "h3"
          }
        },
        "template--16782970093787__2b4d0f83-2801-4d5b-8775-09eb965a7cc9-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We believe that good clothes take you to even better places, and that when you look good, you feel better, which is contagious to everyone around you. </p><p></p><p>From the beach  clubs of Bali, to dive bars in the Caribbean, to your honeymoon in Santorini and summer weekends in The Hamptons, Kenny Flowers has you covered with upscale, versatile essentials that will stand out at the beach, the five-star resort, the rooftop bar, or your buddy’s backyard BBQ.</p>",
            "description_size": "medium"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "template--16782970093787__2b4d0f83-2801-4d5b-8775-09eb965a7cc9-heading-1",
        "template--16782970093787__2b4d0f83-2801-4d5b-8775-09eb965a7cc9-text-1"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Maui-Print-Kenny-Flowers-Tropical-Vacation-hawaiian-short-sleeve-shirt-swim-trunks-cabana-set-matching-couples-2022-boat-party-18-min.jpg",
        "use_video": false,
        "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_9VUPq3SxOc",
        "video_autoplay": true,
        "video_controls": true,
        "height": "adapt",
        "desktop_image_width": "medium",
        "section_width": "grid",
        "layout": "image_first",
        "content_position": "text-left",
        "color_bg": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
        "color_text": "#151515",
        "color_border": "#e2e2e2",
        "disable_top_spacing": true,
        "disable_bottom_spacing": true
      }
    },
    "4698b992-edd5-4e5c-a4bb-73132317759f": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16782970093787__4698b992-edd5-4e5c-a4bb-73132317759f-heading-1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Do Good, Look Good, Feel Good",
            "heading_size": "h3"
          }
        },
        "template--16782970093787__4698b992-edd5-4e5c-a4bb-73132317759f-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We know that with great clothes comes great responsibility. By choosing to buy from Kenny Flowers, you’re fueling a small, family business that gives back every step of the way. Through our partnership with <a href=\"https://kenny-flowers.myshopify.com/pages/ceo4teens\" title=\"CEO4TEENS\">CEO4Teens</a>, an education foundation started by Kenny, we have sent more than 150 students to college in Bali, and sponsored GED’s for 100+ underprivileged Americans since 2015. And we’re just getting started. We’re committed to running a genuine business, leading with our heart, because we feel at our best when we’re doing good and helping others along the way.</p>",
            "description_size": "medium"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "template--16782970093787__4698b992-edd5-4e5c-a4bb-73132317759f-heading-1",
        "template--16782970093787__4698b992-edd5-4e5c-a4bb-73132317759f-text-1"
